 "description": "Incentive Lab separates customer revenue from token subsidy, then allocates a declared reward budget using accepted work and quality weights. Contributor caps and exact budget conservation keep the scenario inspectable. The worksheet does not establish Sybil resistance or distribute tokens. No live subnet data, fraud detection, Bittensor emission replication, staking recommendation or token distribution. Retrieve incentives with fetch or read its example resource to obtain exact inputs. Parameters are processed remotely without application persistence.",
